   "subject": "כמה לינקים בהמשך לסדנת המתקדמים שהייתה היום",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">שלום אנשים,<div><div>היה כיף לראות את מי שבא.</div><div>נהניתי מההרצאות של יזהר יונתן ודרור - תודה רבה לכם על הזמן ושיתוף הידע.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>בהמשך לכמה מהשאלות שעלו היום במפגש (וגם נעלה את זה בהמשך באתר של האיגוד), הנה כמה מדריכים/מאמרים שאולי יעזרו לכם</div>\n\n<div><br></div><div><br></div><div>1) איך לקבוע את המיקומים של טיקים (מרקרים) בתוך פלוט</div><div><a href=\"http://www.r-bloggers.com/using-vectors-to-customize-placement-of-tick-marks-and-labels-on-a-plot/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.r-bloggers.com/using-vectors-to-customize-placement-of-tick-marks-and-labels-on-a-plot/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499016125000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Jh4d0Rh0Dqsf2NyjPj_Zs\">http://www.r-bloggers.com/using-vectors-to-customize-placement-of-tick-marks-and-labels-on-a-plot/</a></div>\n\n<div><br></div><div>2) אינטראקציה עם R:</div><div>שינוי גרפים</div><div><a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/playwith/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/playwith/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499016125000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2GxPvldWZJNh_2p-7yt3XG\">http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/playwith/index.html</a></div><div>אינטראקציה עם גרפים - </div>\n\n<div><a href=\"http://rosuda.org/iplots/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rosuda.org/iplots/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499016125000&amp;usg=AOvVaw336DHO5iFArd5rYWNQFdNW\">http://rosuda.org/iplots/</a></div><div>ודמו מגניב:</div><div><a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZGZStkvnwqI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DZGZStkvnwqI&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499016125000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1cZ6HuEyIWDGYu9XdJ6kOF\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZGZStkvnwqI</a></div><div>ויש את הגירסה החדשה יותר:</div>\n\n<div><a href=\"http://www.rforge.net/Acinonyx/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rforge.net/Acinonyx/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499016125000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Pv_QizuCKZ7ko4NQw6Dz0\">http://www.rforge.net/Acinonyx/</a></div><div>אבל היא בלי &quot;עזרה&quot;</div><div><br></div><div>ויש גם את:</div><div><a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/rggobi/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/rggobi/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499016125000&amp;usg=AOvVaw388aOd7sCjipIyCT4xzmaH\">http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/rggobi/index.html</a></div>\n\n<div>(אבל הוא עלול להיות איטי)</div><div><br></div><div>ולכיף, הנה דוגמא לאנימציה באמצעות R</div><div><a href=\"http://www.r-bloggers.com/a-demo-for-the-ratio-estimation-in-sampling-survey-animation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.r-bloggers.com/a-demo-for-the-ratio-estimation-in-sampling-survey-animation/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499016125000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0lHy_fGmvz7x4cyFVD8ZND\">http://www.r-bloggers.com/a-demo-for-the-ratio-estimation-in-sampling-survey-animation/</a></div>\n\n<div><br></div><div><br></div><div>3) עורכים ל - R</div><div>יש רשימה מפורטת כאן:</div><div><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/R_(programming_language)#Editors_and_IDEs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/R_(programming_language)%23Editors_and_IDEs&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499016125000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2yrmvI52qIheDmy8S_1Sz-\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/R_(programming_language)#Editors_and_IDEs</a></div>\n\n<div>למשתמשי ווינדוז שרוצים התחלה מהירה, שימו לב לאפשרות האחרונה ברשימה:</div><div><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:19px\"><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Notepad%2B%2B\" title=\"Notepad++\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(6,69,173);background-image:none;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-color:initial;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Notepad%252B%252B&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499016125000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0rVJXsVRK2iWL4gsP0pl7z\">notepad++</a><sup style=\"line-height:1em;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\"><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/R_(programming_language)#cite_note-15\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(6,69,173);background-image:none;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-color:initial;white-space:nowrap;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/R_(programming_language)%23cite_note-15&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499016125000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0TEevlh8VM4r2OsscAsUlH\"><span>[</span>16<span>]</span></a></sup>.</span></div>\n\n<div><br></div><div><br></div><div>להתראות בעתיד,</div><div>טל</div><div><a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZGZStkvnwqI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DZGZStkvnwqI&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499016125000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1cZ6HuEyIWDGYu9XdJ6kOF\"></a><br clear=\"all\"><br>----------------Contact Details:-------------------------------------------------------<br>\n\nContact me: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Tal.G...@gmail.com</a> |  972-52-7275845<br>Read me: <a href=\"http://www.talgalili.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.talgalili.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499016125000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0pvXDxOWgA8f7KVBPPeLiG\">www.talgalili.com</a> (Hebrew) | <a href=\"http://www.biostatistics.co.il\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.biostatistics.co.il&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499016125000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2FKjhHA90psdlHmvuAE3kv\">www.biostatistics.co.il</a> (Hebrew) | <a href=\"http://www.r-statistics.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.r-statistics.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499016125000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1a-2wE29HxItalsu9ukV-j\">www.r-statistics.com</a> (English)<br>\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br><br>\n</div></div></div>\n"
